      "seed": 855563589,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 787434179,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "L'âge limite des rentes d'orphelin (T39)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "L'âge limite des rentes d'orphelin (T39)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bJq"
    },
    {
      "id": "bDVtOZsA17ttimhwc0RW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897,
      "y": 14800.5,
      "width": 764.48,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "zbqqcdgMI1WuDUNMu6e4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 58188575,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1922168557,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : quand une victime d'accident du travail décède, ses orphelins reçoivent une\nrente. Ni le recueil des besoins ni l'atelier de Kaya en 2017 ne disent jusqu'à quel âge.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : quand une victime d'accident du travail décède, ses orphelins reçoivent une\nrente. Ni le recueil des besoins ni l'atelier de Kaya en 2017 ne disent jusqu'à quel âge.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bJr"
    },
    {
      "id": "gNWATQfuwyi4IDsQE6jD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897,
      "y": 14848.5,
      "width": 647.36,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "zbqqcdgMI1WuDUNMu6e4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 902755847,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 819919459,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : PRESTATION_ESP, code ARSE, en cours au 31/12, et l'âge\n(IND_DATE_NAISSANCE).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : PRESTATION_ESP, code ARSE, en cours au 31/12, et l'âge\n(IND_DATE_NAISSANCE).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bJs"
    },
    {
      "id": "vVuwyjJZGoMjsi0jf1ik",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897,
      "y": 14896.5,
      "width": 782.5600000000001,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "zbqqcdgMI1WuDUNMu6e4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1379352538,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 208572749,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : comme pour les pensions (voir le point 10), on ne compte que les orphelins de\nmoins de 25 ans.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : comme pour les pensions (voir le point 10), on ne compte que les orphelins de\nmoins de 25 ans.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bJt"
    },
    {
      "id": "4dTMKcpdzYn2CkOjczn8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897,
      "y": 14944.5,
      "width": 735.6800000000001,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "zbqqcdgMI1WuDUNMu6e4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1093740226,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 611825155,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : en 2024, 454 rentiers orphelins de moins de 25 ans, 531 sans limite d'âge.\nL'annuaire CNSS 2024 compte autrement : 485, entre les deux. De 2021 à 2023, ses\nchiffres sont sous les nôtres, comme avec une limite plus basse.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : en 2024, 454 rentiers orphelins de moins de 25 ans, 531 sans limite d'âge.\nL'annuaire CNSS 2024 compte autrement : 485, entre les deux. De 2021 à 2023, ses\nchiffres sont sous les nôtres, comme avec une limite plus basse.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bJu"
    },
    {
      "id": "KqFSy0RZ3EfeSOFDYBKU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897,
      "y": 15012.5,
      "width": 146.24,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "zbqqcdgMI1WuDUNMu6e4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 655929091,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1216929709,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "À qui : DP et DR",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "À qui : DP et DR",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bJv"
    },
    {
      "id": "BM6VUKZ8ozBmC15VCVpb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897,
      "y": 15040.5,
      "width": 751.5200000000001,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "zbqqcdgMI1WuDUNMu6e4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1926555067,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 146275747,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Question : jusqu'à quel âge une rente d'orphelin d'accident du travail est-elle versée ?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
