      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Quand la CNSS paie une coordination",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Quand la CNSS paie une coordination",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bMZ"
    },
    {
      "id": "8riL8Qq9LO0EqePMU4J2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39,
      "y": 16746.5,
      "width": 799.0400000000001,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "dlgKObOiwuFaXasvezQS"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2138048833,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 325251811,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : la CNSS peut verser toute une pension de coordination, puis se faire rembourser\nla part de l'autre caisse. Le montant de T42 serait alors trop haut.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : la CNSS peut verser toute une pension de coordination, puis se faire rembourser\nla part de l'autre caisse. Le montant de T42 serait alors trop haut.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bMa"
    },
    {
      "id": "Ycck2Xy2jQqpxX8tv7wS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39,
      "y": 16794.5,
      "width": 766.88,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "dlgKObOiwuFaXasvezQS"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 392857441,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 2124701901,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : DOS_CATEGORIE = COOR_CNSS ; le montant est la somme des paiements\n(DEBOURS).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : DOS_CATEGORIE = COOR_CNSS ; le montant est la somme des paiements\n(DEBOURS).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bMb"
    },
    {
      "id": "6Xhk0l2ahibfs7lCnAFc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39,
      "y": 16842.5,
      "width": 442.88,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
