      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Les nouvelles pensions des anciens retraités",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Les nouvelles pensions des anciens retraités",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bMq"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4JTGW7GDP6TYYC4Idq6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897,
      "y": 16746.5,
      "width": 805.1200000000001,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "BRyriZetXclDsYcYVncG"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2116012307,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 466420685,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : un retraité peut recevoir une nouvelle pension dans l'application quand la sienne\nest recalculée ou revalorisée. Ce n'est pas un nouveau retraité.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : un retraité peut recevoir une nouvelle pension dans l'application quand la sienne\nest recalculée ou revalorisée. Ce n'est pas un nouveau retraité.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bMr"
    },
    {
      "id": "KLHjZD4mDOfm0k82HPFy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897,
      "y": 16794.5,
      "width": 767.36,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "BRyriZetXclDsYcYVncG"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 418727799,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 374320003,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : une pension de vieillesse (PRESTATION_ESP, RPV ou RPRA) saisie dans\nl'année (PE_DATE_INSERT) pour une personne (IND_ID_PREST) qui en avait déjà une.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : une pension de vieillesse (PRESTATION_ESP, RPV ou RPRA) saisie dans\nl'année (PE_DATE_INSERT) pour une personne (IND_ID_PREST) qui en avait déjà une.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bMs"
    },
    {
      "id": "XPUE3Yo85KsaHO1RNb72",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897,
      "y": 16842.5,
      "width": 602.72,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "BRyriZetXclDsYcYVncG"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2057705000,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 2020934189,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : elles ne comptent pas comme nouvelles (voir le point 4).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : elles ne comptent pas comme nouvelles (voir le point 4).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bMt"
    },
    {
      "id": "YUkzAVkbMxa5NVnTKrq4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897,
      "y": 16870.5,
      "width": 630.08,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "BRyriZetXclDsYcYVncG"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 961554580,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 922043171,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : 220 cas en 2025, 47 en 2024 : près de cinq fois plus en un an.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : 220 cas en 2025, 47 en 2024 : près de cinq fois plus en un an.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bMu"
    },
    {
      "id": "XapcZ6v8EYDjUV224b6Z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897,
      "y": 16898.5,
      "width": 218.56,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "BRyriZetXclDsYcYVncG"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 148299417,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1347302541,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "À qui : DCP, avec la DSI",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "À qui : DCP, avec la DSI",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bMv"
    },
    {
      "id": "4y6qss4Q87SCGLezeklw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897,
      "y": 16926.5,
      "width": 726.24,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "BRyriZetXclDsYcYVncG"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1308288428,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1246160579,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Question : ces 220 nouvelles pensions de 2025 sont-elles des révisions de pensions\nexistantes ?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Question : ces 220 nouvelles pensions de 2025 sont-elles des révisions de pensions\nexistantes ?",
