      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "L'invalide devenu retraité (T42)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "L'invalide devenu retraité (T42)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bN7"
    },
    {
      "id": "7YCq4Ck1GSB0KtJwSmYA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 16746.5,
      "width": 802.5600000000001,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "WNgfYfvfh1u866ZLkss2"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1527341283,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1176090755,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : le recueil demande à la DSI un module qui transformera une pension d'invalidité\nen pension de vieillesse à l'âge de la retraite. Il n'existe pas encore.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : le recueil demande à la DSI un module qui transformera une pension d'invalidité\nen pension de vieillesse à l'âge de la retraite. Il n'existe pas encore.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bN8"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1mtDYcuWGaIOomPQzEm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 16794.5,
      "width": 739.36,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "WNgfYfvfh1u866ZLkss2"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 257157865,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 199116077,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : PRESTATION_ESP, TPE_CODE = RPI pour l'invalidité, RPV pour la\nvieillesse.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : PRESTATION_ESP, TPE_CODE = RPI pour l'invalidité, RPV pour la\nvieillesse.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bN9"
    },
    {
      "id": "Ouvx56hBZxK1RCHfPeaS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 16842.5,
      "width": 769.6,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "WNgfYfvfh1u866ZLkss2"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 899425390,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1542828067,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : sans objet. Avec la règle de la première fois (voir le point 4), l'invalide\nconverti serait compté comme nouveau retraité l'année de la conversion, alors qu'il était\ndéjà pensionné.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : sans objet. Avec la règle de la première fois (voir le point 4), l'invalide\nconverti serait compté comme nouveau retraité l'année de la conversion, alors qu'il était\ndéjà pensionné.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bNA"
    },
    {
      "id": "KHlL1iCYCm2jQlINdmkO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 16910.5,
      "width": 700.1600000000001,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "WNgfYfvfh1u866ZLkss2"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 121192260,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1268193165,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : 119 pensionnés d'invalidité fin 2024 (tableau 18 de l'annuaire CNSS).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : 119 pensionnés d'invalidité fin 2024 (tableau 18 de l'annuaire CNSS).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bNB"
    },
    {
      "id": "yFiSxBEfniePTuLcvg6A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 16938.5,
      "width": 218.56,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "WNgfYfvfh1u866ZLkss2"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2131356078,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 783397827,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "À qui : DCP, avec la DSI",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "À qui : DCP, avec la DSI",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bNC"
    },
    {
      "id": "nE1IhRz08r7jM6cPjzJc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 16966.5,
      "width": 732.8000000000001,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "WNgfYfvfh1u866ZLkss2"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 52899554,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 356949485,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Question : quand ce module existera, l'invalide converti comptera-t-il comme nouveau\nretraité dans T42 ?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Question : quand ce module existera, l'invalide converti comptera-t-il comme nouveau\nretraité dans T42 ?",
      "autoResize": true,
