      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Des paiements d'accident introuvables",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Des paiements d'accident introuvables",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bPr"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bkxt5bzM8znjRMKLpVC6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 18644.5,
      "width": 777.9200000000001,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "eGmv9sOL1TQjGdu2P49l"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1517097915,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1430210723,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : une partie de l'argent versé pour les accidents du travail manque dans la base\ndes prestations : la plupart des soins, une part des rentes et des indemnités journalières.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : une partie de l'argent versé pour les accidents du travail manque dans la base\ndes prestations : la plupart des soins, une part des rentes et des indemnités journalières.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bPs"
    },
    {
      "id": "YQHAxQgrQSWedD5yrJXX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 18692.5,
      "width": 778.72,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "eGmv9sOL1TQjGdu2P49l"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1053311796,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 397494029,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : les paiements (DEBOURS, DEB_TYPE = PM, statut D ou P) et les\nremboursements de soins (DEB_TYPE = RB) des dossiers d'accident du travail (DOSSIER,\nTDOS_CODE = A).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : les paiements (DEBOURS, DEB_TYPE = PM, statut D ou P) et les\nremboursements de soins (DEB_TYPE = RB) des dossiers d'accident du travail (DOSSIER,\nTDOS_CODE = A).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bPt"
    },
    {
      "id": "CKyX5iiXR15Xc1y0aENI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 18760.5,
      "width": 795.6800000000001,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "eGmv9sOL1TQjGdu2P49l"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1486191322,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1815362627,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : on prend ce que la base contient ; les montants des rentes portent la mention «\nincomplet ».",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : on prend ce que la base contient ; les montants des rentes portent la mention «\nincomplet ».",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bPu"
    },
    {
      "id": "XXIfxCMpEKL9cJNuU5BV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 18808.5,
      "width": 805.2800000000001,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "eGmv9sOL1TQjGdu2P49l"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 326871915,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1299111277,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : l'annuaire CNSS 2024 compte plus. Soins de 2024 : 18,8 M dans la base pour 139,7\nM publiés. Rentes viagères de 2024 : 399,4 M pour 455,0 M publiés (tableau 90).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : l'annuaire CNSS 2024 compte plus. Soins de 2024 : 18,8 M dans la base pour 139,7\nM publiés. Rentes viagères de 2024 : 399,4 M pour 455,0 M publiés (tableau 90).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bPv"
    },
    {
      "id": "pEboAglOP10xJ9EVGKqK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 18856.5,
      "width": 296.64,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "eGmv9sOL1TQjGdu2P49l"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1451979352,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 730446819,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "À qui : DSI, avec la DP et les DR",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "À qui : DSI, avec la DP et les DR",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bPw"
    },
