      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pension ou allocation de vieillesse (T50)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pension ou allocation de vieillesse (T50)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bUc"
    },
    {
      "id": "v1vof9jH09ETIPACm92p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 21568.5,
      "width": 801.2800000000001,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "z1SLZnAfXVOaz8ADUXKw"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 583024707,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1973541933,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : une allocation de vieillesse va à un assuré dont la carrière est trop courte pour\nune pension. T50 donne la moyenne de ses mois cotisés (les services passés).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : une allocation de vieillesse va à un assuré dont la carrière est trop courte pour\nune pension. T50 donne la moyenne de ses mois cotisés (les services passés).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bUd"
    },
    {
      "id": "HZ3kKgy4yvqsPhdUPx8i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 21616.5,
      "width": 716,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "z1SLZnAfXVOaz8ADUXKw"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1739621197,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 320538915,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : PRESTATION_ESP, TPE_CODE = RAV ; les mois cotisés sont dans\nPE_MOIS_COTISATION.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : PRESTATION_ESP, TPE_CODE = RAV ; les mois cotisés sont dans\nPE_MOIS_COTISATION.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bUe"
    },
    {
      "id": "WUaDk42aoYGg3Iqa90Zw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 21664.5,
      "width": 613.6,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "z1SLZnAfXVOaz8ADUXKw"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1876145125,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 114282125,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : tous les mois de 1 à 600 entrent dans la moyenne de T50.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : tous les mois de 1 à 600 entrent dans la moyenne de T50.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bUf"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4NkRsxajiZZSI8jzbv7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 21692.5,
      "width": 788.96,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "z1SLZnAfXVOaz8ADUXKw"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 203714369,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1774447811,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : en 2024, 831 allocataires, avec 95,5 mois cotisés en moyenne à la CNSS (environ\n8 ans). Pourtant une allocation de vieillesse en a 489 (40 ans).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : en 2024, 831 allocataires, avec 95,5 mois cotisés en moyenne à la CNSS (environ\n8 ans). Pourtant une allocation de vieillesse en a 489 (40 ans).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bUg"
    },
