    },
    {
      "id": "5cq5bw43DM6uEFdRBvVY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39,
      "y": 24004.5,
      "width": 799.0400000000001,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "xUV12kKGXICk4HYoiVoa"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1550247643,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1131210915,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : pour les prestations familiales, le recueil des besoins fait finir le délai de\nliquidation à une « date de validation », et non à la notification des droits comme l'atelier\nde Kaya en 2017.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : pour les prestations familiales, le recueil des besoins fait finir le délai de\nliquidation à une « date de validation », et non à la notification des droits comme l'atelier\nde Kaya en 2017.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bY8"
    },
    {
      "id": "CNwPsISte0uv9Iu09FSp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39,
      "y": 24072.5,
      "width": 745.6,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "xUV12kKGXICk4HYoiVoa"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 644396585,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 615360269,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794253553496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : trois dates possibles : le calcul initial des droits, la signature de la\nnotification imprimée (NOTIFICATION_PREST), l'approbation du premier paiement.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : trois dates possibles : le calcul initial des droits, la signature de la\nnotification imprimée (NOTIFICATION_PREST), l'approbation du premier paiement.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bY9"
    },
    {
      "id": "8ysaSWGTSMNJ8KKrcPth",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39,
      "y": 24120.5,
      "width": 720.32,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "xUV12kKGXICk4HYoiVoa"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
